It's fine. Text me the where and when and I'll make sure he's there. Speaking of, how is Miss Roxy, Granville's most celebrated drag queen?

KEVIN
I book a few shows occasionally at the Bone-N-Brew. And most of the town likes having me host, whenever there's a party. But I only really book shows when my fan-club is in town.

NARRATOR
Kevin looks up at Gareth, who smiles sheepishly, drawing Hunter's attention.

